  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: test-coverage-output coherence cluster with WI-fugut (Test-Dense column mislabels test-call-edge count as 'tests' and recommends 'may indicate redundant tests'). Both items boil down to the test-coverage subcommand using a definition of 'test' that's not documented and differs from what reasonable consumers expect. Fixing this item (sketch vs subcommand divergence) and WI-fugut (column header wording + interpretation hint) together gives the subcommand a coherent vocabulary; fixing only one leaves an internal contradiction."  # 95fe
